  "trainText": "Train\n\nPush / Pull / Legs ×2 · 6 days/week\n\nLift\nRun\nWeek 1 · General fitness\n1\nPush A\n2\nPull A\n3\nLegs A\n4\nPull B\n5\nPush B\n6\nLegs B\n\nUp next\n\nPush A\n\nStarts with Bench Press\n\n~30 min\n\nHow to do Bench Press\n\nStart workout\n\nWhy this session\n\nBench Press\n\n3 sets × 8 reps · 32.5 kg\n\nLast: 62.5 kg × 8\n\nOverhead Press\n\n3 sets × 8 reps · 20 kg\n\nLateral Raise\n\n2 sets × 10–15 reps · 5 kg\n\nAdd exercise\nShort on time?\nSkip session\n\nStart a training block\n\nPick what the next few weeks are for. Your programme follows.\n\nEmpty workout\nAdd exercises as you go. Your plan stays as it is.",
